      "content": "The pain you describe is real, but it is not permanent, even if it feels like it will last forever. Your mind failing you does not mean your life is over; it means you are in the deepest part of the dark, which is often the most dangerous place to be. There is no point in trying to rebuild what is broken right now; instead, you should focus on finding a way to stop the pain and let your body rest.",
